      and the <a href={DJM_900NXS.sourcePeakLimiter} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Peak Limiter document</a>,
      checked {UPDATED}. Every documented fault above is the manufacturer's own
      wording, condensed. The published firmware history begins at
      {HISTORY_STARTS_AT} and versions 1.22 to 1.25, 1.27 and 1.29 are not listed,
      so this is the record AlphaTheta publishes rather than the full history of
      the product. Two things on this page are contradictions inside AlphaTheta's
      own documents, the A/D bit depth and the macOS support list, and both are
      published here unresolved. The reading of "version 4.0 or later" as the
      player's firmware is our deduction and is labelled as one. The auto standby
      timeout, the dimensions, the weight and the electrical specifications are not
      published for this model, so they do not appear here. Driver versions come
